{"mapId":100545347,"appId":"1","authorId":383005482890592,"title":"4.29空战（纯建筑）","cover":"https://assets.box3.fun/content/7t5NfXdB4JA-IWOIlOkPU9Iu7Se3Eb67xUFUCSjr2bk.jpg","description":"4 月 29 日，日海军航空兵团派佐世保第二航空队空袭武汉，中国空军集中第三、四、五大队及苏联空军志愿大队 67 架驱逐机待命。午后 2 时 15 分，在鄂赣边境发现日军机群，中国空军 62 架驱逐机迅速升空。2 点 40 分，日机 39 架飞临武汉上空，在武昌上空，中方飞机与日机展开激战，飞行员陈怀民在飞机受到 5 架日机围攻时，开足油门冲向一架日机，与之同归于尽。此次空战历时约 30 分钟，共击落日机 21 架，中国空军损失 12 架飞机。","notice":"","version":1,"publishedAt":"2026-01-24T16:10:23.686","updateAt":"2026-01-24T16:10:23.686","playHash":"543719d12a60c68a810b","onlineCount":0,"playCount":12,"favoritesCount":0,"commentCount":2,"viewCount":37,"likeCount":0,"mediaResourcesHash":["https://assets.box3.fun/content/ZHUVhY3spTwO3LXZuvpiWG7i6QjGvR-sPygFGmVhBjo.jpg"],"labels":[{"labelId":3,"labelName":"原创","labelKey":"original"}],"currentReleaseVersion":1,"combType":0,"weight":0,"teamable":false,"_tab":"mapOther"}